95:     /** Return a handle ID for the handle under the mouse, or -1 if
96:      *  none. Needs-More-Work: in the future, return a Handle instance or
97:      *  null. <p>
98:      *  <pre>
99:      *   0-------1-------2
100:      *   |               |
101:      *   3               4
102:      *   |               |
103:      *   5-------6-------7
104:      * </pre>
