Has the original ask been met?  
No. The refactoring introduced an infinite recursion in the overload for MNamespace:

• At lines 2019–2022:
  public void doCopyModelElement(MNamespace source, MNamespace target) {
      doCopyModelElement(source, target);
      // …
  }
This overload now just calls itself rather than delegating to the MModelElement version.  

What needs to be changed?  
Replace that recursive call so that it invokes the MModelElement overload. For example:

  public void doCopyModelElement(MNamespace source, MNamespace target) {
      // delegate to the MModelElement version:
      doCopyModelElement((MModelElement) source, (MModelElement) target);
      // Nothing more to do, don't copy owned elements.
  }

