2111:   /**
2112:    * Enhance/Create the doccomment for the given model element, including tags
2113:    * for any OCL constraints connected to the model element. The tags generated
2114:    * are suitable for use with the ocl injector which is part of the Dresden OCL
2115:    * Toolkit and are in detail:
2116:    *
2117:    * &nbsp;@invariant for each invariant specified
2118:    * &nbsp;@precondition for each precondition specified
2119:    * &nbsp;@postcondition for each postcondition specified
2120:    * &nbsp;@key-type specifying the class of the keys of a mapped association
2121:    * &nbsp; Currently mapped associations are not supported yet...
2122:    * &nbsp;@element-type specifying the class referenced in an association
