310:   /** Inform the human designer using this system that the given
311:    * ToDoItem should be considered. This can be disruptive if the item
312:    * is urgent, or (more commonly) it is added to his ToDoList so that
313:    * he can consider it at his leisure. */
314:   public void inform(ToDoItem item) {
315:     if (item.getPriority() >= disruptiveThreshold())
316:       disruptivelyWarn(item);
317:     else
318:       nondisruptivelyWarn(item);
319:   }
